  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Get Ready to Export</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To accelerate the international success of Vietnamese companies, a three-year program will be started to guide selected SMEs in their international growth. This program is aimed at three specific business sectors: agrofood, horticulture, and manufacturing. The project will tackle specific needs in these sectors.The program consists of three types of service: Training, Coaching, and Networks. The first pillar, training, will be (on- and offline) classroom training on both skills and knowledge. The second pillar, about coaching, is a one-on-one coaching program designed to a company&#x2019;s needs and is delivered through Dutch Business Association (DBAV) members to experienced managers in the field. The third pillar is the networking pillar, where the companies become member of the DBAV network, and are introduced to potential future business partners, and provide the practical side of linkage to European businesses and domestic FDI&#x2019;s and MNE&#x2019;s. In each year, the selected Vietnamese SME will go through one cycle of the 3 pillars, and based on lessons learnt in each year, modifications will be made to the project activities for implementation in the following year, so that the program is more adaptable to the actual needs of the SME and other implementation challenges.</narrative>
  </description>
